post_install() {
    cat <<'EOF'
OpenWrite installed to /opt/openwrite.

Commands:
  openwrite-launcher   recommended entry — bootstraps an isolated Python
                       runtime in ~/.openwrite-runtime/ on first run
                       (installs its Python dependencies automatically),
                       then opens the Studio web UI.
  openwrite            direct CLI (requires the runtime deps; use the
                       launcher first if they are missing).

Studio binds to 127.0.0.1 by default. Configure your model/API key in the
Studio UI on first launch.
EOF
}
